hide empty description
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #F8F9FA
  BorderColor #495057
}

title Liveness session: states and transitions

[*] --> INIT : new session\n(workflow, policy)
INIT --> PASSIVE_CHECK : first frame

state PASSIVE_CHECK : guidance on frames with no face,\nseveral faces or low quality
state PASSIVE_CHECK : s = median of the frame scores\nover the window

PASSIVE_CHECK --> PASSED : s >= pass threshold
PASSIVE_CHECK --> ACTIVE_CHALLENGE : attack < s < pass\nand active check enabled
PASSIVE_CHECK --> FAILED : s <= attack threshold (PAD_ATTACK_DETECTED)\nor attack < s < pass, active check disabled (LIVENESS_BELOW_THRESHOLD)\nor passive timeout (NO_FACE, MULTIPLE_FACES, LOW_QUALITY)

state ACTIVE_CHALLENGE {
  [*] --> HOLD_STILL
  HOLD_STILL : baseline of the measures
  HOLD_STILL --> WAITING_ACTION : baseline ready,\ninstruction shown
  WAITING_ACTION : passive score and face\ncontinuity still checked
  WAITING_ACTION --> HOLD_STILL : action detected,\nchallenges left
  WAITING_ACTION --> [*] : action detected,\nlast challenge
}

ACTIVE_CHALLENGE --> PASSED : all challenges passed\nand mean score > attack threshold
ACTIVE_CHALLENGE --> FAILED : CHALLENGE_TIMEOUT, CHALLENGE_FAILED,\nFACE_CONTINUITY_LOST, PAD_ATTACK_DETECTED

PASSED --> [*] : captured image accepted
PASSED --> FAILED : captured image rejected (INVALID_FRAME,\nFACE_CONTINUITY_LOST, LOW_QUALITY, PAD_ATTACK_DETECTED)
FAILED --> INIT : retry()\nattempts used < max attempts
FAILED --> [*] : attempts exhausted (MAX_ATTEMPTS_EXCEEDED):\nblock, or exception process for residents

note as devices
  From any state, a device or engine error
  ends the attempt in FAILED:
  DEVICE_UNAVAILABLE, DEVICE_CONNECTION_FAILED,
  CAMERA_UNAVAILABLE, ENGINE_ERROR.
end note
@enduml
